+</head>
+<body>
+<header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="Daymark home"><span class="brandmark">d</span><span>daymark</span></a><div class="board-title"><h1>My board</h1><span class="saved"><i></i> Saved locally</span></div><div class="top-actions"><button id="undoBtn" class="icon-button" title="Undo last change (Ctrl/⌘ Z)" aria-label="Undo" disabled>↶</button><button id="themeBtn" class="icon-button" title="Toggle color theme" aria-label="Toggle theme">◐</button><button id="menuBtn" class="button subtle">⋯ <span class="menu-label">Board</span></button><div id="menu" class="menu hidden"><button id="exportBtn">Export backup…</button><button id="importBtn">Import backup…</button><button id="archiveBtn">View archive <span id="archiveCount"></span></button><button id="clearDoneBtn">Clear completed tasks</button><button id="resetBtn" class="danger">Reset board…</button></div></div></header>
+<main><section class="welcome"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR SPACE, YOUR PACE</p><h2>Make room for <em>what matters.</em></h2><p class="subhead">A little progress, every day.</p></div><button class="button primary" id="addTaskTop"><span>＋</span> Add a task</button></section>
+<section class="toolbar" aria-label="Board tools"><label class="search"><span>⌕</span><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Find a task…" aria-label="Search tasks"><kbd>/</kbd></label><div class="filters" id="filters"><span class="filter-label">SHOW</span><button class="filter active" data-filter="all">All <span id="countAll">0</span></button><button class="filter" data-filter="today">Due today</button><button class="filter" data-filter="overdue">Overdue</button></div><div class="view-controls"><button id="sortBtn" class="button subtle small">↕ <span>Sort: manual</span></button></div></section>
